{"choices":[{"finish_reason":"stop","index":0,"message":{"role":"assistant","content":"So you see now, my dear, that I am at the end of my journey, that is, approximately at the most distant point of it, — approximately, for there will probably still be a small excursion into the neighborhood, but my main direction will now be home, towards you; but until now I have had no news from you beyond the letter I received in Cassel; last evening I went straight to the post office after my arrival, but the office was already closed; now it will be seen in an hour whether there are letters from you there q.... In the meantime I will only tell you that I am lodged here with Mr. van Ghert, who did nothing else, and spent the night with him and am feeling quite well. — I wrote to you from Cölln. On Sunday morning I had Wallraf’s paintings shown to me now in daylight; among them was the main picture, the Death of Mary, undoubtedly by the same Master Schoreel, from whom the picture of the same subject, which belongs to Boisseree, and which you have also always loved so much, is; — the Wallraf one is smaller, about 2¼ feet high, but wider. The donor on one wing, like the woman on the other, are exactly the same portraits, they were complete old acquaintances to me — the arrangement of the figures in the picture, the position of the bed etc. is different. — After I had attended the service in the cathedral in Cölln and taken my leave of the good people who had received me so friendly, I drove to Aachen in the afternoon, — in good company with an elderly Englishman who had become a German and a lawyer from Cölln, who always carries Goethe’s Faust as his Bible on his person, while at the same time being quite pleased with himself in an unreserved way. We arrived at 10 o’clock at night. In Aachen I saw the cathedral first, sat on Emperor Charles’s chair; there are two marble plates on the sides, also on the backrest, smooth, 1⅛ inch thick;"}}],"created":1795220524,"model":"qwen","system_fingerprint":"b11429-d81235049","object":"chat.completion","usage":{"completion_tokens":434,"prompt_tokens":552,"total_tokens":986,"prompt_tokens_details":{"cached_tokens":0}},"id":"chatcmpl-N3n8ZZHaICyhf13BBVFvhNtEYKMaI0nr","timings":{"cache_n":0,"prompt_n":552,"prompt_ms":700.458,"prompt_per_token_ms":1.268945652173913,"prompt_per_second":788.0558149096734,"predicted_n":434,"predicted_ms":10053.923,"predicted_per_token_ms":23.21922170900693,"predicted_per_second":43.067765687085526}}